  "title": {
    "type": "text",
    "$t": "來唸七字仔 - 梅香獻策 ——《王月英元夜留鞋記》"
  },
  "content": {
    "type": "html",
    "$t": "\n<div class=\"tg-article\" style=\"color: #333333; font-family: &quot;Microsoft JhengHei&quot;, sans-serif; line-height: 1.8; margin: 0px auto; max-width: 800px;\">\n    <h1 style=\"color: black; font-size: 36px; font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 5px; text-align: center;\">梅香獻策 ——《王月英元夜留鞋記》</h1>\n    \n    \n    \n    <div style=\"margin-bottom: 30px; text-align: center;\">\n        <p style=\"color: #555555; font-size: 20px; margin: 0px;\">/ 蔡天享</p>\n        \n    </div>\n    \n    <div class=\"tg-images\">\n        <div style=\"margin-bottom: 20px; text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEgkzFXdJsTIWOB4WekCbUzxMykuIsijHMmMLwwrReQ8d_yyHfGMgv5ZUNCVeiHq9NXl26icDzPp85v3-Jtqf5iCegAxgh3I__iJRvJhCvOYk2T8sdTdRWe9UqKSLKBIsNm-EbSMthqztSAwiGxSHKcaCVLcNBlgMQCP7-TYG56x0hqEw8O6pMaZkRNWVn9_\" style=\"border-radius: 4px; height: auto; max-width: 100%;\" /></div>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div class=\"tg-content\" style=\"font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 0.5px; margin-bottom: 30px; padding: 0px 10px; text-align: justify;\"><b>\n        王月英<br /></b><br />星暗雲散月tng圓 <br />寒風蝕骨思君暝<br />織女牛郎望相見<br />茶苦飯澀在床邊<br /><br /><b>梅香<br /></b><br />茶飯不思bē得睏<br />秀才弄花起火薰<br />佳人動情心憂悶<br />冬未盡去盼來春<br /><br />Khioh石拋入心內溪<br />莽夫郭華來夯枷<br />出手教示做狗爬<br />護娘保主無e-the<br /><br /><b>王月英<br /></b><br />郎有情來妹有意<br />賤婢胡言厚猜疑<br />惡言傷人惹非議<br />有失禮儀我不依<br /><br /><b>梅香</b><br /><br />既是郎妹有情意<br />你我改扮假男兒<br />小婢盡心獻計智<br />直往秀才ê寄居<br /><br /><b>王月英<br /></b><br />雖非名門貴千金<br />卻有書香閨女心<br />怎thang直入thàng門禁<br />鄰里街市議論深<br /><br /><b>梅香</b><br /><br />胭脂店門瓶花lian<br />後山野地海棠田<br />你我遊賞枝花剪<br />安排秀才訴情緣<br /><br /><b>王月英<br /></b><br />賞花本是尋雅緻<br />花前訴情似吟詩<br />白日tng頭遊人織<br />若遇親友心驚疑<br /><br /><b>梅香</b><br /><br />心愛八風吹不移<br />婢來搭橋扮鵲兒<br />娘做情詩我送至<br />邀約賞燈是好時<br /><br /><b>王月英<br /></b><br />相逢艱難像針ui<br />國有禮法家有規<br />寺無香煙佛不貴<br />會香佳期上元催<br /><br /><b>梅香</b><br /><br />詩文有情暗示君<br />快去急回莫留痕<br />速傳親送趁時tsūn<br />回報主娘待逢春<br />\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"tg-annotations\" style=\"border-top-color: rgb(221, 221, 221); border-top-style: solid; border-top-width: 1px; border-top: 1px solid #ddd; color: #666666; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.5; margin-bottom: 60px; padding: 15px 10px 0px;\">作者註：Tsit篇是讀元代雜劇《王月英元夜留鞋記》了後，有感女婢梅香beh替in阿娘仔王月英kah秀才郭華牽紅線，tsiah創作ê主僕對話。《王》劇描寫王月英約郭華元宵暝tī相國寺會面，無疑悟郭華酒醉睏死，月英等無人，留繡鞋做記認。郭華醒--來tsiânn後悔，吞繡鞋無khuì而亡。官府查案，判姻緣天註定，用神藥救活郭華，賜兩人美滿成親。</div>\n\n    <div class=\"donation-section\" style=\"background-color: #fcfcfc; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgb(238, 238, 238); margin-top: 40px; overflow: hidden;\">\n        <div style=\"width: 100%;\"><img src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEgrm6ZrdT5D8cflnpKmgHArGS0i18gGMCfvYYOsQMYGvcJypk1DuKCJivLqjHRGImdLb5ok0zOyYQ0XLnzH6r_G8NfxaWn6ZufUqqOeS-EbS8chAht4mDWlWriAGBrW82gaiMEedl4j-WOqytl6Wlu2ciuhbXZt4BHNegdW9-6bYUul5M-zGOtEPKCL73sK\" style=\"display: block; width: 100%;\" /></div>\n        <div style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; padding: 30px; text-align: center;\">\n            <div style=\"font-size: 22px; margin-bottom: 15px;\">\n                <b><span style=\"color: #3778cd;\">#台文通訊BONG報</span> 390期，2026年09月出刊。</b>\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"color: #274e13; font-size: 18px; margin-bottom: 10px;\">歡迎捐款贊助　#李江却台語文教基金會</div>\n            <div style=\"color: #38761d; font-size: 16px;\">\n                線上捐款(定期定額) <a href=\"https://donate.newebpay.com/Period/akhioh/lkk\" style=\"color: #3778cd; text-decoration: none;\" target=\"_blank\">點此連結</a><br />\n                線上捐款(單筆) <a href=\"https://donate.newebpay.com/akhioh/lkk\" style=\"color: #3778cd; text-decoration: none;\" target=\"_blank\">點此連結</a>\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"color: #274e13; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.5; margin-top: 15px;\">\n                郵政劃撥：19021486 / 戶名：財團法人李江却台語文教基金會<br />\n                電匯：123-20-050514-2 (華南銀行士林分行)\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"border-top-color: rgb(238, 238, 238); border-top-style: solid; border-top-width: 1px; border-top: 1px solid #eee; color: #050505; font-size: 15px; margin-top: 25px; padding-top: 15px; text-align: justify;\">\n                #李江却台語文教基金會 需要你ê定期捐款，逐年贊助本會（台文通訊BONG報發行單位）NT$2,400，lán做伙復振台灣語文ê事工kap雜誌編印發行費用，捐款thang抵稅。\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</div>"
